# TASK-27 9f, the final step, second hand run (make hand-netsurf-wikipedia-2): what the
# first run's article screens did not show (the page below the fold, a click on a link) and
# a redirect to another host: http://wikipedia.org/ (port 80) goes to https://www.wikipedia.org/.
# Screens only (build/shots/); nothing asserted.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
pause 3000
type netsurf https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%B0\r
pause 60000
wheel 400 400 down 6
pause 4000
shot wp2-ru-scroll-1
wheel 400 400 down 15
pause 4000
shot wp2-ru-scroll-2
click 640 435
pause 40000
shot wp2-ru-link
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type netsurf http://wikipedia.org/\r
pause 60000
shot wp2-redirect-host
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type echo closed\r
screen closed
type poweroff\r
exit
